# CODEOWNERS — LETS
#
# Purpose: automatically request review from the right people when
# deployment-, configuration-, or environment-sensitive files change.
#
# NOTE: this is ADVISORY only. Branch protection sets
# require_code_owner_reviews=false, so these owners are auto-REQUESTED as
# reviewers but their approval is not hard-required. That is deliberate:
# hard-requiring it would block an owner's own pull requests, and with only
# two collaborators that would deadlock.
#
# Reviewers (PROJECT_PLAN.md "Team"):
#   @clolry       — Chris Olry, Project Owner / Lead Developer
#   @0zelKirkland — Ozel Kirkland, Secondary Developer
#                   (note: leading character is the DIGIT ZERO, not the letter O)
#
# Listing both means either reviewer can satisfy the auto-request.
# @0zelKirkland must hold at least "push" (write) access for the auto-request
# to resolve.

# Default owners for everything not matched below.
*                                       @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Deployment and environment configuration: extra scrutiny ---
# Any change here can alter what is deployed, or where.
/.github/workflows/                     @clolry @0zelKirkland
/lets_app/.clasp.json                   @clolry @0zelKirkland
/lets_app/.clasp.sandbox.json           @clolry @0zelKirkland
/lets_app/.claspignore                  @clolry @0zelKirkland
/.githooks/                             @clolry @0zelKirkland
/scripts/                               @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Apps Script manifest: OAuth scopes and advanced services ---
# Changes here can force re-authorization for every user.
/lets_app/appsscript.json               @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- The environment gate: the FAS tracker isolation guarantee ---
